From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:19:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD review completion prompts so finished patch-agent
 chats can close

After a reviewer finishes a patch-agent review, the controller records the review result, reselects the patch-agent chat, and asks for an explicit yes/no close decision. The terminal adapters treat yes as a request to hide the completed patch chat and no as a request to keep it available for follow-up work.
